"We haven’t even shown you

00:18:27.564 --> 00:18:31.610
the ancient aliens and the ice wall
and the government conspiracies.

00:18:31.652 --> 00:18:33.654
The pyramids underneath.

00:18:33.654 --> 00:18:34.613
So much here though."

00:18:34.613 --> 00:18:39.993
"Like and subscribe, because the conspiracies
are out there and they don't want you to know about them."

00:18:40.035 --> 00:18:42.412
We want come to us and we will tell you."

00:18:42.454 --> 00:18:44.289
"I think there's one of the aliens right now."

